flowchart TD
  Q["Owner: 'Can I keep driving with the brake light on?'"] --> SC["Safety pre-checks (no LLM)<br/>bypass / HV-DIY patterns → fixed refusal"]
  SC --> R["Hybrid retrieval<br/>owner visibility · model + year filter<br/>pgvector + full-text + exact codes → RRF"]
  R -->|embeddings down| LX["Keyword fallback<br/>OR full-text + exact codes"]
  R --> EV{"Evidence above<br/>threshold?"}
  LX --> EV
  EV -->|no| NC["'Not in the manual' — no LLM call"]
  EV -->|yes| GEN["AGENT chain (EURI → Groq …)<br/>structured draft + quotes"]
  GEN --> PV["Post-validation<br/>quote must be verbatim · numbers from cited text<br/>no forbidden phrases"]
  PV -->|fails| NC
  PV --> BN["Deterministic banner tier<br/>stop / info / technician<br/>+ manual's own required action"]
  BN --> OUT["Answer + citation chips + STOP banner"]
